\begin{itemize}
\item[S1] ULAM.AI and the UnsolvedMath Contributors, UnsolvedMath: A Curated Collection of Open Mathematics Problems, record 6700012 (AMR-066-0012). Catalogue attribution under CC BY 4.0.
